Upper-case SSH passthrough must not swallow the distinct X- userspace namespace.
-- input --
example:/path /target sshfs X-mount.mkdir=bad,X-future.option=value,ServerAliveInterval=15 0 0
-- issues --
Error: Invalid value 'bad' for sshfs mount option 'X-mount.mkdir' on line 1, must be an octal integer
Info: Unverified userspace X- extension 'X-future.option' on line 1: value syntax and semantics were not checked
